1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,242
Here is part of a practice passage about fog nets.

2
00:00:03,242 --> 00:00:13,671
Paragraph four says the attraction of the method is not its output, which is modest, but its cost: no fuel, no electricity, no technician.

3
00:00:13,671 --> 00:00:18,216
Statement four: fog nets cost less to install than a deep tube well.

4
00:00:18,216 --> 00:00:19,361
Cheap, yes.

5
00:00:19,361 --> 00:00:21,458
But a tube well is never mentioned.

6
00:00:21,458 --> 00:00:28,294
The comparison is not in the passage, even though it may well be true, so the answer is not given.

